   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Two shaders, one mix\n\n**kubakub shader mix** runs two shaders and one **mix** value: 0 is shader A (here *plasma*), 1 is shader B (*eight bit*). `how` = *b works on a* means B takes A's picture as its own, so at 1 you see plasma on an old game console. `curve` = *triangle* lets the mix go there and back.\n\n**Try:** `how` = *a cuts b* with A = *voronoi cells*, B = *fire* (a wipe in the shape of the cells) · *a bends b* with A = *caustics*, B = *stripes* · curve = *beats* with a sound on `audio` · a picture or a clip on `image`: both shaders work on it (A = *vhs tape*, B = *halftone*).\n"
   ]
  }
